WEBVTT

00:25.900 --> 00:28.611
GREEN DOLPHIN STREET STATE PRISON

00:37.454 --> 00:38.413
Stop right there!

00:38.496 --> 00:39.706
What's going on here?

00:39.789 --> 00:41.666
What are you doing?

00:44.586 --> 00:46.504
ULTRA SECURITY HOUSE UNIT

00:46.588 --> 00:49.591
Prisoner FE40536.

00:49.674 --> 00:51.968
Name, Jolyne Cujoh.

00:52.051 --> 00:55.388
This is the second time
you've caused us trouble.

00:55.472 --> 00:57.182
First, you attempted a jailbreak.

00:57.265 --> 01:00.602
And now, at the prison mausoleum,

01:00.685 --> 01:04.481
a female inmate has been found dead
from blunt force head trauma.

01:04.564 --> 01:08.651
And yet, you refuse to talk
and continue to act defiantly.

01:09.277 --> 01:10.779
For some reason,

01:10.862 --> 01:14.657
violence and death follow you
wherever you go.

01:14.741 --> 01:16.951
We have no proof that you're the culprit,

01:17.035 --> 01:19.913
but you are, without a doubt,
the troublesome type.

01:23.792 --> 01:25.210
Therefore, from now on,

01:25.293 --> 01:27.587
you will be disciplined
according to protocol.

01:29.422 --> 01:31.007
You are hereby confined

01:31.090 --> 01:35.011
for an indefinite amount of time
in this Ultra Security House Unit.

02:04.332 --> 02:05.166
Fuck!

02:05.834 --> 02:08.503
- Fuck!
- There's a woman!

02:11.673 --> 02:13.341
The newcomer's a woman!

02:13.424 --> 02:16.469
I smell a woman!

02:16.553 --> 02:20.140
Her smell is seeping out under the door!

02:23.434 --> 02:24.686
What the hell?

02:25.353 --> 02:27.105
Yes!

02:27.188 --> 02:30.191
I got shit on her face!

02:30.733 --> 02:34.571
My own shit, on a woman's face!

02:35.155 --> 02:37.991
I want to bash her up too!

02:39.909 --> 02:43.830
One thing that must not happen here
is the exhaustion of my mental strength.

02:44.414 --> 02:48.209
The unnecessary stress
and the physical toll it takes.

02:49.377 --> 02:55.466
There is something I must accomplish
in this Ultra Security House Unit!

02:58.887 --> 03:00.471
I must succeed, no matter what.

03:01.389 --> 03:05.310
And for that, I must not waste any energy.

03:07.353 --> 03:08.354
No.

03:08.855 --> 03:10.982
I will grow even stronger!

03:19.073 --> 03:22.493
It may be possible to attain heaven.

03:23.202 --> 03:24.454
23 YEARS AGO

03:24.537 --> 03:27.165
Hey, don't look so glum.

03:27.248 --> 03:29.417
I'm not talking about death.

03:30.001 --> 03:32.295
The heaven I'm talking about

03:32.378 --> 03:34.422
has to do with the soul.

03:35.089 --> 03:36.799
The place our soul travels to.

03:36.883 --> 03:39.802
The power of our soul
must surely evolve there.

03:39.886 --> 03:42.764
I'm talking about
the final form of our souls.

03:43.389 --> 03:46.935
Surely, you, out of anyone else
are able to comprehend.

03:47.936 --> 03:50.521
True happiness lies there.

03:50.605 --> 03:53.191
But this is contingent upon
attaining heaven.

03:53.775 --> 03:55.026
I know happiness is not attained

03:55.109 --> 03:57.862
by obtaining the mightiest body,
having lots of money,

03:57.946 --> 04:02.158
or having dominion over others.

04:02.825 --> 04:04.786
True victory

04:04.869 --> 04:06.955
belongs to those who have seen heaven.

04:09.499 --> 04:11.084
I will do everything…

04:13.294 --> 04:15.630
…to reach that end.

05:50.433 --> 05:52.810
Let's say I place
this sticker on this pen.

05:52.894 --> 05:53.895
EPISODE 13: SMACK OF LOVE AND REVENGE (1)

05:53.978 --> 05:57.023
It then creates a copy of the pen.

05:58.024 --> 05:59.484
This is my ability.

06:00.234 --> 06:02.028
I call it Smack.

06:02.111 --> 06:03.321
Peel the sticker off, and…

06:05.239 --> 06:08.076
the pen fuses back together
with force, leaving a fissure.

06:08.159 --> 06:09.827
It is now easier to destroy.

06:10.495 --> 06:15.041
I take this ability as my sign from God.

06:22.965 --> 06:24.425
He'll remember in no time

06:25.593 --> 06:28.721
that this seal of kiss
is my license for revenge.

06:30.056 --> 06:32.517
Good morning, Father.

06:33.226 --> 06:36.562
May I have one of these flowers?

06:36.646 --> 06:39.273
I've grown a fondness for them recently.

06:39.357 --> 06:41.484
Of course, feel free to take it.

06:41.567 --> 06:43.694
Sports Maximum.

06:54.872 --> 06:57.375
F.F., she's cutting in front of you.

06:58.376 --> 07:00.795
Hey, I said she cut in line.

07:00.878 --> 07:01.921
I know.

07:02.922 --> 07:03.923
For some reason,

07:04.006 --> 07:07.176
I feel like the others
don't accept me here.

07:07.260 --> 07:09.262
It's like they're looking down on me.

07:10.138 --> 07:11.764
Don't cut, dumbass!

07:11.848 --> 07:12.932
Tell her off.

07:13.015 --> 07:15.017
I disagree with you.

07:15.726 --> 07:17.395
It's not good to force something.

07:18.229 --> 07:21.232
You have to change yourself
before seeking approval from others.

07:21.315 --> 07:22.150
Isn't that right?

07:22.692 --> 07:26.571
So, I decided to do the exact opposite
of what I usually do.

07:27.947 --> 07:29.574
What's the opposite of coffee?

07:29.657 --> 07:30.616
Tea?

07:30.700 --> 07:35.204
That's right. Atroe's body,
which I took over, is craving coffee.

07:35.288 --> 07:36.789
So I go with tea instead.

07:37.373 --> 07:38.207
On purpose.

07:42.295 --> 07:43.254
Does that make sense?

07:45.756 --> 07:48.342
Instead of bread, I eat rice.

07:48.426 --> 07:52.221
Use my non-dominant left hand
instead of my right hand to eat.

07:52.847 --> 07:55.766
I'm trying to change myself
by doing the exact opposite.

07:55.850 --> 07:57.602
Listen, F.F.

07:57.685 --> 08:00.146
The wound where I got shot…

08:01.147 --> 08:02.857
It hurts like hell.

08:02.940 --> 08:04.192
I told you.

08:04.275 --> 08:06.819
I can only fill the holes with plankton.

08:06.903 --> 08:09.572
The rest is up to
your body's ability to heal.

08:09.655 --> 08:11.199
- Got that?
- Damn.

08:12.617 --> 08:15.411
Jolyne, what's the opposite of pork?

08:15.495 --> 08:17.163
Maybe chicken, or even beef.

08:17.246 --> 08:19.665
The opposite of pork is salmon.

08:19.749 --> 08:21.792
Pigs lie around in mud all day.

08:21.876 --> 08:24.670
Salmons swim against the current
to go upstream.

08:25.421 --> 08:26.631
I love that.

08:27.340 --> 08:28.883
They're cutting again.

08:28.966 --> 08:31.594
Scram, bitch! Come on, tell them off!

08:31.677 --> 08:34.347
Like I said, I'm trying
the exact opposite.

08:34.972 --> 08:36.682
Like dragging people into the line.

08:36.766 --> 08:38.684
Come along now, right here.

08:38.768 --> 08:40.353
What's the matter with you?

08:40.436 --> 08:42.355
I won't let you cut in front of me.

08:42.438 --> 08:43.856
Don't touch me, bitch.

08:43.940 --> 08:45.942
Go to the back, dumbass!

08:46.025 --> 08:48.110
What did you call me, bitch?

08:48.194 --> 08:50.238
- The hell?
- Look at that.

08:50.321 --> 08:52.657
It's so much easier to grab food now.
Easy as pie.

08:56.619 --> 08:59.413
By the way, where's Ermes?

08:59.497 --> 09:01.958
I haven't seen her for a few days.

09:02.041 --> 09:04.043
Haven't you heard?

09:07.171 --> 09:08.881
She's following a man?

09:08.965 --> 09:10.424
Is Ermes really doing that?

09:10.508 --> 09:13.219
Yeah. Every morning for a while now.

09:13.302 --> 09:17.098
Even when you got shot, Jolyne.

09:21.310 --> 09:23.145
I haven't seen Jolyne.

09:23.229 --> 09:25.189
Something's going on in the courtyard.
Looks bad.

09:28.609 --> 09:30.611
Hey, Ermes!

09:32.321 --> 09:34.490
Leave her be.

09:37.785 --> 09:40.246
The inmate Ermes is tailing?

09:40.329 --> 09:43.207
Yes. You know all the rumors around here.

09:43.291 --> 09:44.584
That's correct.

09:44.667 --> 09:47.044
I'm honored you came to me, Jolyne.

09:48.713 --> 09:52.466
Oh, you don't expect me
to tell you for free, right?

09:53.175 --> 09:54.760
An information fee.

09:54.844 --> 09:57.179
I'll give you a friend's discount.

10:05.479 --> 10:06.314
Found it.

10:07.356 --> 10:12.111
"The body of a female thought to have been
caught in the crossfire of gang violence

10:12.194 --> 10:14.280
was found by the river before dawn."

10:14.363 --> 10:15.906
Florida's local papers.

10:15.990 --> 10:17.575
It's dated six years ago.

10:17.658 --> 10:20.119
It's exactly as Gwess said.

10:22.246 --> 10:23.831
Gloria Costello.

10:23.914 --> 10:26.542
So she is Ermes's older sister.

10:28.628 --> 10:29.962
THE NEXT DAY

10:31.756 --> 10:33.841
Over the last few days,

10:33.924 --> 10:35.468
I've waited for the right time

10:35.551 --> 10:37.845
 as I watched you, carefully and closely.

10:39.180 --> 10:41.223
I don't know what caused you
to change your heart,

10:41.307 --> 10:44.894
but I watched you sweeping
the old prison's graveyard.

10:44.977 --> 10:47.188
You also left flowers at a grave.

10:47.813 --> 10:49.649
Were they for your fellow gang members

10:49.732 --> 10:51.567
who were executed in the electric chair?

10:53.110 --> 10:55.071
I also watched you

10:55.154 --> 10:58.699
making taxidermy birds and alligators
in the prison's workshop.

10:59.700 --> 11:03.746
Now, why would a grunt like you take up
a sudden interest in such a hobby?

11:04.705 --> 11:06.624
Well, none of that matters.

11:07.375 --> 11:11.128
But there's one thing I must know.

11:14.256 --> 11:16.050
Jolyne, F.F.

11:16.133 --> 11:18.260
You seem well, Ermes.

11:18.969 --> 11:21.305
Here you go. Your share of breakfast.

11:24.433 --> 11:25.559
Ermes,

11:25.643 --> 11:27.728
about that man you are following…

11:27.812 --> 11:30.064
Following? I don't know what you mean.

11:30.648 --> 11:31.816
Don't play stupid.

11:32.608 --> 11:34.777
His name is Sports Maximum.

11:34.860 --> 11:37.029
He is a notorious gangster
in the outside world.

11:37.113 --> 11:39.407
But now, he is incarcerated
in the male wing here.

11:39.490 --> 11:42.785
Is that so? Not that it concerns me.

11:42.868 --> 11:43.828
Ermes.

11:43.911 --> 11:49.083
You were sent here at Green Dolphin
for armed robbery.

11:51.127 --> 11:54.547
Did you do that just to become
a convict at this facility?

11:55.548 --> 11:59.176
For you to exact revenge on Sports Maximum
for your sister's death.

11:59.760 --> 12:00.678
Jolyne.

12:00.761 --> 12:03.139
You don't pry into
other people's business in prison.

12:03.222 --> 12:04.432
Really?

12:04.515 --> 12:07.518
Well, I'm doing opposites today.

12:10.563 --> 12:12.231
I don't need you to butt in.

12:12.314 --> 12:13.774
Go back to the female wing.

12:16.277 --> 12:18.946
Ermes is right, Jolyne.

12:19.029 --> 12:21.198
You have your own mission to worry about.

12:22.199 --> 12:23.409
I know.

12:25.369 --> 12:27.037
Just a little longer, Gloria.

12:28.205 --> 12:31.041
I'll avenge you with my own hands.

12:35.546 --> 12:36.881
Ermes.

12:37.465 --> 12:40.551
Think of me as your mother from now on.

12:46.140 --> 12:47.558
From that day on,

12:48.267 --> 12:49.518
Gloria…

12:49.602 --> 12:53.898
you always put the family first.

12:55.316 --> 12:56.484
Ermes.

12:56.567 --> 12:59.195
You can help at the store
sometimes, you know.

12:59.278 --> 13:04.366
I want you to inherit
your father's restaurant with me.

13:04.450 --> 13:07.244
The hell should I care.
I'm getting out of here.

13:07.745 --> 13:10.831
I want to get a cross-country scholarship
and go to college.

13:11.499 --> 13:13.876
Don't act all high and mighty
and tell me what to do.

13:13.959 --> 13:15.044
Ermes!

13:16.962 --> 13:17.796
Don't leave!

13:31.352 --> 13:33.145
Help me…

13:34.313 --> 13:37.942
Fetch me that thick stick with your mouth.

13:38.025 --> 13:42.321
Not like a dog, but as a baby would do it.

13:59.755 --> 14:02.174
I'm not interested in seeing
what lies in the dark.

14:02.258 --> 14:04.552
I wouldn't report it
to the authorities either.

14:05.386 --> 14:08.889
The darkness will handle
those who live by it. 

14:09.640 --> 14:14.603
That's the only way to keep
a restaurant open in that city.

14:15.187 --> 14:16.272
But that night…

14:27.324 --> 14:32.329
Gloria had no choice but to put herself
in danger and call the police.

14:32.413 --> 14:34.248
She did it to protect me.

14:34.915 --> 14:35.875
But even then…

14:37.918 --> 14:40.170
Defendant Sports Maximum,

14:40.254 --> 14:42.423
you are hereby sentenced
to five years in prison

14:42.506 --> 14:43.632
for tax evasion and assault.

14:44.758 --> 14:47.344
Five years? Only five years?

14:48.888 --> 14:51.974
We can't corner him with a weak witness.

14:52.808 --> 14:54.351
This is the best we can do.

14:54.435 --> 14:56.562
He had her killed!

14:56.645 --> 14:58.397
He destroyed all evidence of that.

15:00.941 --> 15:02.443
Bullshit.

15:02.526 --> 15:04.278
- Wait. Wait, dammit!
- Stay put!

15:07.740 --> 15:10.075
Fucking bastard!

15:27.718 --> 15:29.553
So you do remember her.

15:29.637 --> 15:31.180
That's right.

15:32.598 --> 15:34.183
You must not forget Gloria.

15:36.727 --> 15:39.521
Gloria!

15:47.655 --> 15:50.908
I've been waiting for this chance.

15:50.991 --> 15:56.038
I've been waiting for you to be alone
so no one can hear your screams.

15:56.121 --> 15:59.249
That's what I've been wanting to know.

15:59.750 --> 16:02.503
The things you made Gloria suffer through.

16:03.462 --> 16:04.838
Sports Maximum.

16:05.506 --> 16:08.258
I'll make you remember them!

16:13.222 --> 16:14.890
STAND NAME: SMACK
STAND MASTER: ERMES COSTELLO

16:18.477 --> 16:19.979
The hell is this?

16:20.062 --> 16:22.147
What are you doing to me, bitch?

16:22.231 --> 16:25.275
Your sentence ends in about a year.

16:25.359 --> 16:27.820
Once you're free, you'll have bodyguards.

16:28.737 --> 16:30.781
But you are defenseless in here!

16:33.325 --> 16:35.703
Yes. It's a perfect fit for you.

16:35.786 --> 16:40.582
It's true that prison pipes are not
big enough to fit a human being.

16:41.166 --> 16:44.670
But that means
it fits you perfectly as a coffin.

16:46.547 --> 16:48.382
Is that the sound of you falling down?

16:48.465 --> 16:49.925
Hey, help me out.

16:50.009 --> 16:51.468
Who the hell are you?

16:51.552 --> 16:53.637
Let me out, now!

16:53.721 --> 16:57.850
- You still don't understand who I am?
- What?

16:57.933 --> 17:00.853
Take the last few moments of your life
to think it through.

17:01.353 --> 17:03.814
You left Gloria's body in the gutter.

17:04.565 --> 17:07.651
And her suffering drove my father ill.

17:08.318 --> 17:09.611
I…

17:09.695 --> 17:11.155
lost everything.

17:12.573 --> 17:15.826
Beg them for forgiveness in hell,
Sports Maximum!

17:16.326 --> 17:19.830
If you can with that mouth
full of wastewater, that is!

17:24.460 --> 17:26.920
I placed a second sticker on the pipe.

17:27.504 --> 17:30.257
It'll be a lid for this coffin.

17:33.218 --> 17:34.887
It's completely closed now.

17:34.970 --> 17:37.931
Now, scream all you want.

17:38.015 --> 17:40.809
- You bitch!
- Go on, call for help.

17:40.893 --> 17:45.147
Only cockroaches and rats will hear you.

17:47.941 --> 17:50.402
You belong in the gutter, bastard.

17:50.486 --> 17:53.530
Now try to scream, Sports Maximum!

17:55.199 --> 18:01.997
Those who rise from the darkness,
Limp Viscuit… Come forth and join me…

18:03.248 --> 18:09.254
We will share joy
in the darkness, Limp Viscuit…

18:27.940 --> 18:29.274
Something's there.

18:29.900 --> 18:32.319
It's coming towards me.

18:38.367 --> 18:40.369
This attack!

18:40.452 --> 18:41.328
It can't be!

18:41.411 --> 18:42.788
Sports Maximum can't be…

18:56.385 --> 18:58.053
Fuck, my finger.

18:59.596 --> 19:00.931
He's using a Stand ability.

19:01.014 --> 19:03.684
I don't understand why I can't see it,

19:03.767 --> 19:06.103
but I definitely felt its form.

19:06.603 --> 19:07.980
It was bird-shaped!

19:14.653 --> 19:16.155
Sticker…

19:28.834 --> 19:31.837
Did I win? Did I crush it?

19:32.963 --> 19:36.300
I couldn't have known that
he gained a Stand ability.

19:36.383 --> 19:37.467
How's that?

19:38.093 --> 19:41.221
Sports Maximum, you've gone quiet.

19:41.305 --> 19:44.141
Did you get crushed inside that pipe?

19:45.184 --> 19:48.478
Or did the filthy water fill you up
from your mouth to your asshole,

19:48.562 --> 19:51.023
drowning you to death?

20:16.340 --> 20:18.467
What is it now?

20:21.386 --> 20:24.348
Is Sports Maximum still alive?

20:24.890 --> 20:27.726
He must still be alive in that pipe,

20:27.809 --> 20:29.895
hence this strange unseen power.

20:38.111 --> 20:40.239
It's bigger than the last one.

20:44.243 --> 20:45.118
It's fast!

20:52.292 --> 20:53.293
This power…

20:53.377 --> 20:56.797
Could it be the stuffed alligator
from the workshop?

20:56.880 --> 20:58.715
Earlier, that was…

20:59.883 --> 21:02.344
the bird's corpse moving around.

21:02.427 --> 21:04.763
The invisible corpses
have gained the power to move.

21:04.846 --> 21:07.224
They're the ones attacking me!

21:08.308 --> 21:09.977
That bastard.

21:10.060 --> 21:12.271
He's trying to bust the pipe
and break free!

21:12.354 --> 21:13.689
Ermes.

21:14.690 --> 21:16.316
Why are you up there?

21:16.400 --> 21:17.818
Ermes.

21:17.901 --> 21:19.444
Jolyne is worried about you--

21:19.528 --> 21:22.864
Jolyne, F.F, don't come any closer!

21:31.123 --> 21:33.458
- F.F!
- There's an enemy.

21:33.542 --> 21:34.543
There's an alligator.

21:35.127 --> 21:38.171
Invisible, dead beasts
are crawling around!

21:45.971 --> 21:47.806
Damn, it got my leg.

21:47.889 --> 21:50.726
Ermes, just what is happening here?

21:50.809 --> 21:53.562
- Is this a Stand attack?
- That's right.

21:53.645 --> 21:55.397
It's that bastard, Sports Maximum.

21:55.480 --> 21:58.859
He gained a Stand ability
without me knowing…

22:01.361 --> 22:03.739
Run! It's charging towards you!

22:04.323 --> 22:06.491
It's already on the move!

22:06.575 --> 22:07.868
Stone Ocean!

23:41.336 --> 23:46.341
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
